{"synopsis":"Suatu hari dungeon muncul tibatiba Manusia dengan kekuatan yang telah di bangkitkan kemudian menghadapi dungeon ini demi harapan dan kekayaan Protagonis kita saeki tidak memiliki kemampuan\nDemi menghasilkan uang yang cukup untuk perawatan adiknya yang memiliki suatu penyakit yang tidak bisa di sembuhkan dia memutuskan untuk menjadi seorang adventurer Saeki memiliki rahasia di kehidupan sebelumnya dia adalah mage terkuat Karena reinkarnasinya dia harus naik level untuk mendapatkan kekuatannya semula\nIni adalah kisah dari seseorang yang tidak memiliki kemampuan yang akan membalikkan dunia dengan kekuatannya","alternative_title":"禁忌の転生大魔道士","author":"AONO Hakuto","artist":"Chieri","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"1b206dcd-1991-424a-ba0e-b0fd322ed90c","number":"117","chapter":"117","title":"","date":"2025-09-23","released":"2025-09-23"},{"chapter_id":"cf690872-c691-4ba3-977f-1894631950f1","number":"116","chapter":"116","title":"","date":"2025-09-16","released":"2025-09-16"},{"chapter_id":"6831d0f3-01a6-4b7d-9750-430b226f9a29","number":"115","chapter":"115","title":"","date":"2025-09-09","released":"2025-09-09"},{"chapter_id":"86725a72-c3fb-4829-b9bb-08cb9fbc6a42","number":"114","chapter":"114","title":"","date":"2025-09-02","released":"2025-09-02"},{"chapter_id":"06a10124-d615-4d63-8dad-93eab73f5585","number":"113","chapter":"113","title":"","date":"2025-08-26","released":"2025-08-26"},{"chapter_id":"f973f69a-9e67-48e7-9ce6-7138ab8c4413","number":"112","chapter":"112","title":"","date":"2025-08-19","released":"2025-08-19"},{"chapter_id":"a28598f1-7dcc-439a-9318-457354c52a65","number":"111","chapter":"111","title":"","date":"2025-08-12","released":"2025-08-12"},{"chapter_id":"850dcb52-a50b-46c3-8fcb-7009b4dbe029","number":"110","chapter":"110","title":"","date":"2025-08-05","released":"2025-08-05"},{"chapter_id":"84d8feb1-0c54-4079-94a2-ef9050cde164","number":"109","chapter":"109","title":"","date":"2025-07-29","released":"2025-07-29"},{"chapter_id":"6a8e3eb1-ed